# Does the ball go through the wall?
#
# Bonds still break when a projectile clips the edge of what it passes through,
# so damage alone cannot answer this. Measure how far the ball actually got.
look 0.8 0
probe
aim 0 5810
verify-aim 0 5810
fire ball
wait 40
expect-stopped 6      # it must not be more than 6 m past the wall it hit
report
